Grammar

    0 $accept: calculo $end

    1 calculo: calculo expr ENTER
    2        | ε

    3 expr: expr MAIS expr
    4     | expr MENOS expr
    5     | expr VEZES expr
    6     | expr DIV expr
    7     | ABRE expr FECHA
    8     | NUMERO


Terminals, with rules where they appear

    $end (0) 0
    error (256)
    ENTER (258) 1
    MAIS (259) 3
    MENOS (260) 4
    VEZES (261) 5
    DIV (262) 6
    NUMERO (263) 8
    ABRE (264) 7
    FECHA (265) 7


Nonterminals, with rules where they appear

    $accept (11)
        on left: 0
    calculo (12)
        on left: 1 2
        on right: 0 1
    expr (13)
        on left: 3 4 5 6 7 8
        on right: 1 3 4 5 6 7


State 0

    0 $accept: • calculo $end

    $default  reduce using rule 2 (calculo)

    calculo  go to state 1


State 1

    0 $accept: calculo • $end
    1 calculo: calculo • expr ENTER

    $end    shift, and go to state 2
    NUMERO  shift, and go to state 3
    ABRE    shift, and go to state 4

    expr  go to state 5


State 2

    0 $accept: calculo $end •

    $default  accept


State 3

    8 expr: NUMERO •

    $default  reduce using rule 8 (expr)


State 4

    7 expr: ABRE • expr FECHA

    NUMERO  shift, and go to state 3
    ABRE    shift, and go to state 4

    expr  go to state 6


State 5

    1 calculo: calculo expr • ENTER
    3 expr: expr • MAIS expr
    4     | expr • MENOS expr
    5     | expr • VEZES expr
    6     | expr • DIV expr

    ENTER  shift, and go to state 7
    MAIS   shift, and go to state 8
    MENOS  shift, and go to state 9
    VEZES  shift, and go to state 10
    DIV    shift, and go to state 11


State 6

    3 expr: expr • MAIS expr
    4     | expr • MENOS expr
    5     | expr • VEZES expr
    6     | expr • DIV expr
    7     | ABRE expr • FECHA

    MAIS   shift, and go to state 8
    MENOS  shift, and go to state 9
    VEZES  shift, and go to state 10
    DIV    shift, and go to state 11
    FECHA  shift, and go to state 12


State 7

    1 calculo: calculo expr ENTER •

    $default  reduce using rule 1 (calculo)


State 8

    3 expr: expr MAIS • expr

    NUMERO  shift, and go to state 3
    ABRE    shift, and go to state 4

    expr  go to state 13


State 9

    4 expr: expr MENOS • expr

    NUMERO  shift, and go to state 3
    ABRE    shift, and go to state 4

    expr  go to state 14


State 10

    5 expr: expr VEZES • expr

    NUMERO  shift, and go to state 3
    ABRE    shift, and go to state 4

    expr  go to state 15


State 11

    6 expr: expr DIV • expr

    NUMERO  shift, and go to state 3
    ABRE    shift, and go to state 4

    expr  go to state 16


State 12

    7 expr: ABRE expr FECHA •

    $default  reduce using rule 7 (expr)


State 13

    3 expr: expr • MAIS expr
    3     | expr MAIS expr •
    4     | expr • MENOS expr
    5     | expr • VEZES expr
    6     | expr • DIV expr

    VEZES  shift, and go to state 10
    DIV    shift, and go to state 11

    $default  reduce using rule 3 (expr)


State 14

    3 expr: expr • MAIS expr
    4     | expr • MENOS expr
    4     | expr MENOS expr •
    5     | expr • VEZES expr
    6     | expr • DIV expr

    VEZES  shift, and go to state 10
    DIV    shift, and go to state 11

    $default  reduce using rule 4 (expr)


State 15

    3 expr: expr • MAIS expr
    4     | expr • MENOS expr
    5     | expr • VEZES expr
    5     | expr VEZES expr •
    6     | expr • DIV expr

    $default  reduce using rule 5 (expr)


State 16

    3 expr: expr • MAIS expr
    4     | expr • MENOS expr
    5     | expr • VEZES expr
    6     | expr • DIV expr
    6     | expr DIV expr •

    $default  reduce using rule 6 (expr)
